      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks hacky that update mCurrentUpStreamStartTime inside createBuilder.\nAt least you need some comments talking about the reason. Also I think you need to aware that there is potential race condition problem if you change upstream things when you deal with downstream. Because tethering have separate state machine for downstream and upstream and they communicated each other asynchronous, having global variable like this and touch it both in downstream (createBuilder would be called from downstream flow) and upstream code flow always have potential race condition problem.",
